        "legal_accept_hint" to "By tapping “Accept” you confirm that you have read the privacy policy and the terms of use and agree to them. You can read them again later under More → Privacy and terms.",
        "legal_changes_body" to "These texts are stored in the app and are not loaded from the internet. If they change with a new version, the app asks you again at the next start. An update that leaves the texts unchanged does not ask you again. If you decline, the app closes.",
        "legal_changes_title" to "Changes",
        "legal_contact_body" to "Daybreak itself is responsible for Daybreak. You can reach us about these texts, about privacy, your account and your subscription by e-mail at contact@daybreak.playfrolic.xyz.",
